>	1)  how can you open up boxes with the key?
>	    had hexagonal key for a hexagonal lock but
>	    now what the hell do I do?
>

To open a box, you must occupy the same space as the box and then apply ('a')
your key.  When it asks you for the direction, press the period key.

>	2)  why won't the shopkeeper let you 
>	    out of the shop once you're in?
>
If you pick anything up in the shop you must pay ('p') for it before you leave.
If you don't have enough gold to pay, you must either drop the item, attack
the shopkeeper (not wise with a low level character), or find another way to
escape the shop.

>	3)  what good are statues? 
>
Statues can be broken with the proper tools.  They can be wielded and can
be used to bash monsters, open boxes, etc. just like any other weapon.


>	4) will your pet follow you down to other levels?
>	   a few times I came back up and the kitten/dog
>	   turned nasty on me.  Do you need a leash? 
>	
Your pet will follow you down to another level.  It must accupy a space
next to you before you go down or up a staircase.

